(========================================================================================) Tj T*
(YOJANAMITRA SCHEME REFERENCE   SMALL BUSINESS OWNERS) Tj T*
(Compiled from official Indian Government sources | Generated: 22 November 2026) Tj T*
(NOTICE: This is a reference document compiled by YojanaMitra. It is NOT an official government publication.) Tj T*
(For authoritative information, visit the official portal URLs listed for each scheme.) Tj T*
(========================================================================================) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([1]) Tj T*
(SCHEME: Pradhan Mantri MUDRA Yojana \(PMMY\)) Tj T*
(ID: pm-mudra) Tj T*
(Official Portal: https://www.pib.gov.in/PressReleasePage.aspx?PRID=2240159&lang=1&reg=48) Tj T*
(Last Verified: 2026-11-21) Tj T*
(Source: Department of Financial Services, Government of India, PMMY 2026 information) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(DESCRIPTION:) Tj T*
(  Collateral-free institutional credit for eligible small businesses and micro-) Tj T*
(  enterprises.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFICIARIES:) Tj T*
(  Individuals and micro-enterprises with eligible income-generating business activities) Tj T*
(  in manufacturing, trading, services or allied agriculture.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ELIGIBILITY:) Tj T*
(  ['The applicant must be otherwise eligible for credit and have a business plan; the) Tj T*
(  lending institution assesses repayment and loan eligibility.', 'Tarun Plus is for) Tj T*
(  borrowers who have successfully repaid a previous Tarun-category loan.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFITS:) Tj T*
(  - Loans are offered in Shishu \(up to  50,000\), Kishor \(above  50,000 up to  5) Tj T*
(lakh\), Tarun \(above  5 lakh up to  10 lakh\) and Tarun Plus \(above  10 lakh up to  20) Tj T*
(lakh for eligible Tarun graduates\). Interest and repayment terms are set by the) Tj T*
(lender.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(HOW TO APPLY:) Tj T*
(  ['Apply through a participating bank, NBFC or microfinance institution, or use the) Tj T*
(  JanSamarth government portal where available.', 'The lender reviews the business plan) Tj T*
(  and supporting documents; loan approval is not automatic.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([2]) Tj T*
(SCHEME: Prime Minister's Employment Generation Programme \(PMEGP\)) Tj T*
(ID: pmegp) Tj T*
(Official Portal: https://www.kviconline.gov.in/pmegpeportal/dashboard/notification/Revised_PMEGP_Scheme_Guidelines_07122023_compressed.pdf) Tj T*
(Last Verified: 2026-11-21) Tj T*
(Source: Khadi and Village Industries Commission, revised PMEGP guidelines and portal) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(DESCRIPTION:) Tj T*
(  Credit-linked margin-money subsidy programme for establishing eligible new micro-) Tj T*
(  enterprises.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFICIARIES:) Tj T*
