(  Individuals and other eligible entities setting up new viable micro-enterprises in) Tj T*
(  manufacturing or service/business activities permitted by the guidelines.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ELIGIBILITY:) Tj T*
(  ['An individual applicant must be over 18; there is no income ceiling for a new) Tj T*
(  project.', "Only eligible new projects qualify. For projects above the guideline's) Tj T*
(  cost thresholds, at least Class VIII education is required; existing units and) Tj T*
(  activities on the negative list are excluded."]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFITS:) Tj T*
(  - Bank-financed project support with a margin-money subsidy. Subsidy rates and) Tj T*
(maximum eligible project costs vary by category, location, sector and current) Tj T*
(guidelines; the balance is financed by the bank.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(HOW TO APPLY:) Tj T*
(  ['Submit an application through the official KVIC PMEGP e-portal and select the) Tj T*
(  implementing agency and financing bank.', 'Complete bank appraisal and prescribed) Tj T*
(  entrepreneurship development training/verification steps under current rules.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([3]) Tj T*
(SCHEME: PM Street Vendor's AtmaNirbhar Nidhi \(PM SVANidhi\)) Tj T*
(ID: pm-svanidhi) Tj T*
(Official Portal: https://www.mohua.gov.in/documents/guidelines/guidelines-pradhan-mantri-street-vendors-atmanirbhar-nidhi-pm-svanidhi-scheme-UTM0EDNtQWa) Tj T*
(Last Verified: 2026-11-21) Tj T*
(Source: Ministry of Housing and Urban Affairs, PM SVANidhi guidelines \(updated operational documents\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(DESCRIPTION:) Tj T*
(  Working-capital credit and repayment/digital incentives for eligible street vendors.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFICIARIES:) Tj T*
(  Street vendors identified under the scheme, including eligible vendors with a) Tj T*
(  Certificate of Vending, identity card or Letter of Recommendation through the urban) Tj T*
(  local body process.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ELIGIBILITY:) Tj T*
(  ['Applicants must meet the current street-vendor identification and urban-local-body) Tj T*
(  criteria.', 'Documents or a Letter of Recommendation may be needed for vendors) Tj T*
(  missing from the survey; details depend on the local body and current guidelines.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFITS:) Tj T*
(  - The restructured scheme provides staged working-capital loans and may provide) Tj T*
(interest subsidy and digital-transaction incentives for eligible) Tj T*
(repayment/transactions. Current tranche amounts and incentives are set by the latest) Tj T*
(guidelines and lender.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(HOW TO APPLY:) Tj T*
(  ['Apply through the official PM SVANidhi portal or with assistance from the urban) Tj T*
(  local body, a banking correspondent or an authorized lender.', 'Vendor identification) Tj T*
(  and loan appraisal follow the current MoHUA and lender process.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
