([4]) Tj T*
(SCHEME: PM Vishwakarma) Tj T*
(ID: pm-vishwakarma) Tj T*
(Official Portal: https://www.pib.gov.in/Pressreleaseshare.aspx?PRID=2070029&lang=2&reg=48) Tj T*
(Last Verified: 2026-11-21) Tj T*
(Source: Ministry of MSME and Press Information Bureau, PM Vishwakarma operational guidelines) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(DESCRIPTION:) Tj T*
(  Recognition, skills, toolkit, credit and market support for traditional artisans and) Tj T*
(  craftspeople.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFICIARIES:) Tj T*
(  Self-employed artisans and craftspeople working with hands and tools in one of the 18) Tj T*
(  notified traditional trades.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ELIGIBILITY:) Tj T*
(  ['Applicants must meet the age, trade, self-employment, family and prior-benefit) Tj T*
(  conditions in the current guidelines.', 'Registration and a multi-level verification) Tj T*
(  process are required; a single family member is covered under applicable rules.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFITS:) Tj T*
(  - Benefits include recognition, basic/advanced training with a stipend, toolkit) Tj T*
(e-voucher up to  15,000, and collateral-free enterprise loans in two tranches up to) Tj T*
( 1 lakh and  2 lakh at the notified concessional rate. Later-tranche conditions) Tj T*
(apply.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(HOW TO APPLY:) Tj T*
(  ['Register through a Common Service Centre on the official PM Vishwakarma portal.',) Tj T*
(  'The application is verified by the Gram Panchayat/Urban Local Body and other) Tj T*
(  designated authorities before benefits are approved.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
